---
source: crates/runtime/tests/models/search.rs
description: "SELECT id, answer, question, subject, trunc(_score, 3) as _score FROM vector_search(qs, 'second', answer) order by _score desc, id LIMIT 4"
---
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: _score DESC NULLS FIRST, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).id ASC NULLS LAST, fetch=4                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |   Projection: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).id, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).answer, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).question, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).subject, trunc(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer)._score, Int64(3)) AS _score |
|               |     SearchTelemetry                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |         Projection: search_index._score, base_table.answer, search_index.answer_embedding, search_index.id, base_table.question, base_table.question_embedding, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source, base_table.subject                                                               |
|               |           Sort: search_index._score DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |             Projection: search_index.id, search_index.answer_embedding, search_index._score, base_table.answer, base_table.question, base_table.question_embedding, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source, base_table.subject                                                           |
|               |               Left Join: search_index.id = base_table.id                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                 SubqueryAlias: search_index                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                   SubqueryAlias: search_index                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                     Projection: CAST(tbl.key AS Int64) AS id, tbl.data AS answer_embedding, Float64(1) - tbl.distance AS _score                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                       TableScan: tbl                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |                 Projection: base_table.answer, base_table.id, base_table.question, base_table.question_embedding, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source, base_table.subject                                                                                                             |
|               |                   TableScan: base_table projection=[answer, id, question, question_embedding, reference_answer, source, subject]                                                                                                                                                                 |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [_score@4 DESC, id@0 ASC NULLS LAST], fetch=4                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |   SortExec: TopK(fetch=4), expr=[_score@4 DESC, id@0 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |     ProjectionExec: expr=[id@3 as id, answer@1 as answer, question@4 as question, subject@8 as subject, trunc(_score@0, 3) as _score]                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |       SearchTelemetryExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |         RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |           ProjectionExec: expr=[_score@2 as _score, answer@3 as answer, answer_embedding@1 as answer_embedding, id@0 as id, question@4 as question, question_embedding@5 as question_embedding, reference_answer@6 as reference_answer, source@7 as source, subject@8 as subject]                |
|               |             HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Left, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(id@0, id@1)], projection=[id@0, answer_embedding@1, _score@2, answer@3, question@5, question_embedding@6, reference_answer@7, source@8, subject@9]                                           |
|               |               CoalescePartitionsExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |                 ProjectionExec: expr=[CAST(key@1 AS Int64) as id, data@0 as answer_embedding, 1 - distance@2 as _score]                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                   RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                     CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                       BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                         S3VectorsQueryExec (INDEX_NAME_1): limit=100                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |               SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                 BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                   DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[1]                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
